Bridge Android Preview is an independent WebView client for a user-hosted
Herdr Remote Bridge PWA. It is not the official Herdr Android application and
is not endorsed by its authors.

This Android client is provided under GNU AGPL version 3 or later.
Its interoperability reference is weikeyi/herdr-remote-bridge commit
4e80d943579c7213cce78dedeb87df04a428f649, based on Herdr Mobile Relay by
Christophe Vidal. The hosted PWA remains a separate, AGPL-licensed component;
its source and notices are available in that Bridge branch. No hosted PWA
bundle or upstream executable is embedded in this APK.
